<title>INDIA: Indian Airlines 1996/97 loss 407.5 mln rupees.</title>
<headline>Indian Airlines 1996/97 loss 407.5 mln rupees.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>State-run domestic carrier Indian Airlines incurred a net loss of 407.5 million rupees in 1996/97 (April-March) against a loss of 1.09 billion rupees the previous year, the Civil Aviation Ministry said on Friday.  </p>
<p>The ministry said in a statement that it expected the airline to record a net profit of 953 million rupees in 1997/98.</p>
</text>
